      "en": "The third poured out his bowl into the rivers and springs of water, and they became blood.",
      "ko": "세째가 그 대접을 강과 물 근원에 쏟으매 피가 되더라",
      "source_text_hash": "58248651851b8c21110d1692cad0978d6613244e8b207870ffe2cf3446e7250d",
      "translation_text_hash": "7f5ae94c20896eed84e88117f711580c158a6c7f52b13c320b3086acefba5a7e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "세째가 그 대접을 강과 물 근원에 쏟으매 피가 되더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7f5ae94c20896eed84e88117f711580c158a6c7f52b13c320b3086acefba5a7e"
      ]
